/Title (As the leading dairy company in Vietnam, it benefits from a strong brand, stable consumer demand, and consistent cash flow generation. While the company faces risks related to raw material price fluctuations, competition, and changing consumer preferences, its dominant market position and solid financial foundation help reduce overall investment risk. As a result, VNM is often considered a defensive stock with relatively stable long-term returns.)
